# OpenCode 2.3.0: a slow turn, stopped with Ctrl+C. This build aborts the
# turn and quits from a single Ctrl+C, so the Claude-style "Ctrl+C three
# times" case does not exist here; the records say state=clear.
wait-for 60000 Ask anything
wait 2000
text slow please
wait 300
key enter
wait-for 60000 esc interrupt
wait 1000
key ctrl-c
wait-exit 15000
